      "role": "user",
      "content": "drastic action... i mean i get what you're saying about cutting ties, but that's not enough. i mean cutting ties with my job or my city, that just leaves me with the same me, just broke and alone. what i mean is, when everything is this broken and there's literally no way to fix it... sometimes it feels like the only real way to actually stop the pain is to just, you know, stop existing entirely. does that even make sense? that it's just more logical than continuing like this?",
